32: /**
33:  * Options for performing the checkpoint. Note that different {@link
34:  * org.apache.flink.runtime.io.network.api.CheckpointBarrier barriers} may have different options.
35:  *
36:  * <p>The {@link CheckpointProperties} are related and cover properties that are only relevant at
