653:     /**
654:      * Restores the base DB by merging multiple state handles into one. This method first checks if
655:      * all data to import is in the expected key-groups range and then uses import/export.
656:      * Otherwise, this method falls back to copying the data using a temporary DB.
657:      *
658:      * @param keyedStateHandles the list of state handles to restore the base DB from.
659:      * @param startKeyGroupPrefixBytes the min/start key of the key groups range as bytes.
660:      * @param stopKeyGroupPrefixBytes the max+1/end key of the key groups range as bytes.
661:      * @throws Exception on any restore error.
662:      */
663:     public void mergeStateHandlesWithClipAndIngest(
664:             List<StateHandleTransferSpec> keyedStateHandles,
