94:  * <p>Basic checkpoint metadata layout:
95:  *
96:  * <pre>
97:  *  +--------------+---------------+-----------------+
98:  *  | checkpointID | master states | operator states |
99:  *  +--------------+---------------+-----------------+
100:  *
101:  *  Master state:
102:  *  +--------------+---------------------+---------+------+---------------+
103:  *  | magic number | num remaining bytes | version | name | payload bytes |
104:  *  +--------------+---------------------+---------+------+---------------+
