131:          * this time.
132:          *
133:          * @param expectedState expectedState describes the required state to run the action after
134:          *     the delay
135:          * @param action action to run if the state equals the expected state
136:          * @param delay delay after which the action should be executed
137:          * @return a ScheduledFuture representing pending completion of the task
138:          */
139:         ScheduledFuture<?> runIfState(State expectedState, Runnable action, Duration delay);
140:     }
