104:      * the lazy deletion, if the path is a directory, the exists check may have false positives.
105:      */
106:     public RealPath mappingEntry(Path path) {
107:         String fileName = path.toString();
108:         MappingEntry entry = mappingTable.getOrDefault(fileName, null);
